==Requirements==
Player must complete [[Quest:Learn to Mine & Smelt Ore]] in order to do [[Quest:Your First Weapon]]
==To Start==
Speak with [[Cleetus Farnum]] that can be found on [[Farnum's Farm]] located in Southern [[Wilds]].
==Goals==
Learn how to forge weapons with Cleetus Farnum's help.
*Forge a Funky Scrapper Hammer
*Return to Cleetus Farnum
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Cleetus Farnum]] that can be found on [[Farnum's Farm]] located in Southern [[Wilds]].
#*"These Hooligans have been causing us a lot of problems and picking up after a mess is only part of the solution. We need to stop them from breaking things in the first place." -Cleetus Farnum
#*"Since you’ve been so helpful around here I’m going to give you everything you need to craft yourself a better hammer. Use this Anvil to forge a Spunky Scrapper Hammer." -Cleetus Farnum
#**Player receives:
#***10 Copper Bars
#***5 Turquoise
#***5 Wooden Planks
#***5 Thorny Fasteners
#Forge a Funky Scrapper Hammer
#*Forge the Funky Scrapper Hammer at the nearby Blacksmith Anvil.
#Speak with [[Cleetus Farnum]] that can be found on [[Farnum's Farm]] located in Southern [[Wilds]].
#*"That’s one mighty hammer, I hope you won’t have to put it to good use too often." -Cleetus Farnum
